WEBVTT

00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:32.625
And one of the reasons work sucks
for so many people is other people.

00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:35.768
So I sat down with Esther
for a lively discussion

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:39.393
about how we can get better
managing our work relationships.

00:01:39.417 --> 00:01:42.000
(Upbeat music)

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:46.851
(Applause)

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:49.768
So Esther, I was hoping
you would bring a couch.

00:01:49.792 --> 00:01:51.893
Esther Perel: So that you could lay down?

00:01:51.917 --> 00:01:53.976
AG: Yeah, are we not
doing therapy tonight?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.375
EP: Where should we begin?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.042
AG: I feel like you
should probably tell me,

00:01:59.917 --> 00:02:01.434
but we're not doing therapy.